00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:49.440
He abandoned <i>you</i> .

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:52.400
Why do you have to put it that way?

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.690
Listen, Rika, you won't
understand this yet, but--

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.850
You stink like alcohol!

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:06.930
Wonder Egg Priority

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.230
Leon will eat anything, even when he's small.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.190
They seem carnivorous, though.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:32.650
Mine's omnivorous as well.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.520
Yo!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.730
Episode 7: After School at 14

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.350
Happy birthday, Rika!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.440
Thanks.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.940
We've got to celebrate.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.900
It'll be Ai's not-a-shut-in party, too.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.190
Talk about sudden. What happened?

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:50.560
I realized beating myself up at home
wouldn't solve anything.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:54.600
"Beating yourself"? Whoa, kinky.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.770
That's not what I meant!

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.520
Are you sure?

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.690
But was it all right?

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.400
Weren't you bullied?

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:06.270
It was fine, although I have no idea why.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:09.690
Everyone seemed cautious with me,
maybe because I was out.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.690
You call that "fine"?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:14.350
Yeah, thanks to all of you.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.850
Even if I'm alone at school,
I have three friends outside.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.150
You said it.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.520
Yeah!

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.480
If anything happens, tell us.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.100
If worse comes to worst, feed them to Leon.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.770
They're essentially Haters.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:27.810
Thanks.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.400
Don't mention it.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.810
Friends really are great, huh, Ai?

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.230
Tell us if you have problems, too, Rika.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:36.600
Sure thing.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:41.810
I'm gonna make you listen to me grumble all day!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.100
Grumble?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.940
My flush of daddies.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.690
You've got sugar daddies?!

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:53.770
As if!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.100
One of these five is my real daddy.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.310
So, which one is it?

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.150
Rika?

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.230
Don't you think this one's
eyebrows look like mine?

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.270
Huh?

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:09.100
That said, even I don't know the answer.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.020
Honestly, I'm not even sure
he's one of these guys.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.980
What do you mean?

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.190
I made a promise with this woman.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:20.690
When I got into middle school,
I could meet my daddy.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.020
She promised, but...

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.600
Well, you see,

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.230
I don't know either.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:37.480
I'm pretty sure it's one of these guys, though.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.480
Don't make that face.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:49.440
You're my genuine daughter. I gave birth to you.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.810
There's no doubt about that!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.560
That part pisses me off the most.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.400
That's awful.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.100
Right?

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:08.190
That woman can't stand the idea of me
meeting Daddy and getting along with him.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.730
Why not?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.650
She'll never allow me to be happy.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:16.730
Because she's a tragic heroine
with a persecution complex.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.020
Stop.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.980
You shouldn't insult your mom so much.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.770
What? Aren't you on my side?

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:28.480
I am. That's why I'm telling you.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:43.350
I don't want to trash talk my mother either.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:47.190
But she's nothing like your moms.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:50.310
She throws a fit when things don't go her way,

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.940
and all she tells me are half-assed lies.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:57.100
She's never told me she's sorry for anything!

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:01.690
The only thing she does have is her damn pride.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:06.310
She "should have been happier,"
even though it's her own fault.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.980
So, she hates me, too.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:14.730
Like she could have been happy
if only she hadn't had me.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:19.810
I'm sure she has her reasons, too.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.850
Do you hate her as well?

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.480
Huh?

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:26.150
Isn't that what they call "codependence"?

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:30.400
If you don't make a clean break, nothing will--

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.520
Don't try to lecture me, goody-two-shoes!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.310
I've had it!

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.690
Rika!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.900
Gross.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:07.100
I figured you'd chase after me, Ai.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.770
I figured you wanted me to.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.560
I'll join you.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.810
Doing what?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.560
Insulting our moms.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.020
Don't force it.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.440
I've got complaints, too.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.520
Plus,

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.350
we're the Single-Mother Girls.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.980
That's some name.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:35.600
Ai.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.690
Hm?

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:40.600
I'm Serious Rika right now.

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:41.940
So...

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:47.520
What was all that about, then?

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:51.440
I just remembered all the bad things at once.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.690
It made it harder.

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:58.850
Right now, I hate my mom, too.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:05.440
Lately, I've been wondering
if I'll end up like her someday.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.310
We'll be fine.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.730
I guess.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.230
Sometimes, adults seem like a different species!

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:22.900
Like, don't they get married
and bang because they <i>like</i> it?

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.100
Is it because we're kids?!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:33.060
I just

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:35.600
don't get it!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.850
Rika Kawai

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.850
Did you leave already?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.850
Sorry for earlier.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.850
Are you okay?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:47.400
That was Rika, right?

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.850
She seems fine.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.100
I wonder.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:55.940
Don't worry. I'm sure she'll be
back to her usual self tomorrow.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.810
Maybe I'm not cut out for female society.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:00.940
Why not?

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.310
I can't help saying what I think.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.980
What I think is logical and correct.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:11.520
You're fine that way, Neiru.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.100
I hate it when everyone just pretends to agree.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:19.100
I don't know what it's like
to worry about parents.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:22.560
You get along with yours, huh?

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.980
I've never had either.

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.600
Huh?

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:33.020
It seems as if that spared me a lot of trouble.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.770
The smallest one of all those
lights is probably our bar.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.350
Wow.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:43.730
How often do you see your daddy, Ai?

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:47.020
Hmm... About once a month.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.480
You're lucky.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.480
Your mom doesn't take your daddy away.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:56.850
He's still your daddy,
even if your parents broke up.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.150
Yeah.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.520
I fantasize about mine.

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:04.520
All the more because I can't see him.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:08.020
"A beautiful woman never needs a wallet."

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.020
His gentle voice is all I remember.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.350
I can't... remember his face.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.730
You'll meet him someday.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:20.730
Someday.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.770
I want to meet him now.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.190
Now.

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:33.350
Moping over!

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.190
See you!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.690
Thanks, Ai!

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.100
Okay.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.400
Bye-bye.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.190
Mannen!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.810
Handle the Haters!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.060
Teacher?!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.980
So, this is today's assignment.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.810
Thank goodness.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:05.520
Now you'll be saved, too.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.770
Huh?

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.560
You know Ikeda Clinic?

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.520
--Yeah.
--The old guy there is awful at giving shots.
--Chiaki, got any pickles?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.310
No way. That's awful.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.310
Oh, Rika. Happy birthday.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:17.400
Evening.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.400
What? It's her birthday?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.560
Yeah! Today's the day.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.980
Welcome home.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.940
Wow. How old is she?

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.940
Rika!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.940
Go ahead and eat your cake.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:45.270
Drop dead.

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:59.020
No.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.940
My little turtle, Mannen. <i>Redi</i> .

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.440
<i>Redi</i> . Come back.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.230
Your worries will go away.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.350
All of them.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.520
Every last one!

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.440
Who is this guy?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:32.770
The teacher! He'll connect us
to the cosmic truth!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.600
Entrust everything to me.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.020
Do so, and you will be saved.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.270
Shove it, you old creep!

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:48.650
Take this!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.230
Ow...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.400
Piece of cake! All bark and no bite.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.690
What have you done?! You attacked the teacher!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.940
Teacher?

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.850
Of love, the universe, and the spiritual!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.190
Huh?

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:10.440
Mom was in poor health,
and Dad was struggling at work.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:13.350
We were cursed by karma from our past lives!

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:17.270
So, we abandoned our attachments
to the physical world!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.150
We got rid of our house and money

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:22.690
so our whole family could connect to the cosmos!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.980
Are you stupid?

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:27.560
You got swindled and then killed yourselves.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.400
You suffer, too, don't you?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.230
What?!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.270
Deep down, we're all the same.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.150
All fixated on worthless
appearances and hierarchies.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.940
The haves grow arrogant;

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.730
the have-nots grow envious.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.190
Is this some kind of new-age lecture?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:50.560
As if you don't cut yourself.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:55.980
Erase yourself.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.600
That will make it easier.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.980
It can be easier?

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.480
Yes!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:07.400
Acca, how is Rika doing?

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.770
Focus on your own battles.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.940
I'm worried. She was crying.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.940
She might be in a fix.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:15.980
Ura-Acca.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:16.810
Please!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.690
Tell me what's happening!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.190
Rika

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:24.020
gave up on fighting.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:30.520
All those held in my arms are linked
to the mysteries of the cosmos.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.480
You're still tense.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:38.310
Don't worry.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:41.650
See? It doesn't hurt, does it?

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:43.150
No.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.690
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:51.770
Your tiny self can become part of a vast energy.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:53.690
My tiny self...

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.060
You'll become one with the teacher.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:16:01.980
There's no need to envy or hate anyone.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.440
You'll erase your karma

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.560
and connect.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.020
Could be nice.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:11.060
No, that would be nice.

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.440
Rika!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:15.230
Don't be fooled!

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:16.600
Ai?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.810
Yeah.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.730
And not just me. We're all here.

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:23.190
This isn't like you, Rika.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:26.900
Are you going to let it end
in a place like this?!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.900
And what is "like me"?!

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:33.150
Rika! Pull yourself together!

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:33.980
--Rika!
--Rika, don't be fooled!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:37.650
--Rika, say something!
--Rika, hang on!
--Rika, don't be fooled!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.650
I'm worn out.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.690
Relax and surrender yourself.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:51.190
That's right, Rika.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.600
I was saved that way, too.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:55.730
Yeah.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:57.480
I want...

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.980
...to be saved, too.

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.900
Will we lose one?

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:05.690
Looks like it.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:10.440
Now, the hug of life!

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:13.400
Daddy...

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.940
Hmm?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.310
Mannen.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.270
What's that turtle doing?!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.610
Don't interfere!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:35.100
Mannen, you're supposed to deal with the Haters.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:39.690
I get it.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.480
He imprinted on me,

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.440
so he thinks I'm his mom.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:52.190
And you've got to... protect your mom.

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:57.560
Rika!

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:58.680
Rika, please!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:17:59.310
Rika, come back!

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.440
We're all here!

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:00.930
Rika!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.190
Mannen!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.690
That was close.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:09.810
I almost turned into a selfish,
piece-of-shit mother.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.270
My mom taught me one true thing.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:16.770
Men who ask women for money

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.850
are all fakes!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.310
He's real!

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:27.850
The teacher is real!

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:30.520
He channels the cosmos!

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.520
Believe what you want!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.600
Who cares

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.940
if he channels it

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:41.730
or scrambles it?!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.520
Let's go, Mannen!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.350
I'll knock you off your feet

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.520
with a shot to the heart!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.650
Whoa! You're heavy.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.060
There, there.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:31.230
But you're weak, too.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.440
You cut yourself.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.520
I am weak.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:41.480
That's why I use this to balance so
I don't have to ditch things I care about.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:44.150
I'm weak,

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:48.350
but that's the real me.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.900
Even if it means hurting myself,

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.940
I'm going to live!

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.520
Rika!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.560
Whoa.

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:01.900
This is the real "hug of life."

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.650
Rika.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:09.900
Rika...

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.940
...don't die.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.770
Same to you.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:26.270
Now, what should we do today?!

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:28.020
What? What?

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.980
You're still awake?

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.600
I got hungry.

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.650
There's cake in the fridge.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:47.730
I bet the cream's all dried out, though.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.400
It really was the blink of an eye.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.520
I got old before I knew it.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.520
You're only 40.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:01.690
Thirty-eight.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:09.020
You're right. It is dried out.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.650
I'm sure

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:15.150
you'll abandon me, too, Rika.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.730
Yeah.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.600
But not now.

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:26.850
I see.

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:02.020
Next time

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:59.560
To be continued.
